    its Edit page via page.goto(href), locate the Price input using accessibility-role
    based selectors, increase the numeric price by 37% (rounded to 2 decimals), fill
    the new price, click Save, and return to the grid to continue.

    This version fixes the previous possible unbound-variable error by ensuring all
    locator variables are initialized before use and by being defensive around
    Locator.count() and .nth() calls.
